  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "まわりの　くうきを　こおらせてこおりのマスクで　かおを　まもりせびれを　こおりのつるぎに　かえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "주변의 공기를 얼려서 얼음 마스크로 얼굴을 보호하고 등지느러미를 얼음 검으로 바꾼다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "凍結周圍的空氣，以冰之面罩保護臉部，並將背鰭變成冰劍。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il gèle l’air alentour pour protéger son visage avec un masque de glace et doter sa crête dorsale de lames gelées.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es friert die Luft ringsum ein, um sein Gesicht mit einer Maske aus Eis zu schützen und seine Rückenflosse in Eisklingen zu verwandeln.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Congela el aire a su alrededor para cubrirse el rostro con una máscara de hielo protectora y dotar su placa dorsal de cuchillas glaciales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Congela l’aria circostante per proteggere il muso con una maschera di ghiaccio e ricoprire la cresta dorsale di lame di ghiaccio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Arctibax freezes the air around it, protecting its face with an ice mask and turning its dorsal fin into a blade of ice.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "まわりの　空気を　凍らせて氷のマスクで　顔を　守り背びれを　氷の剣に　変える。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会冻结周围的空气，以冰之面罩来保护脸部，并将背鳍变为冰剑。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Congela el aire a su alrededor para cubrirse el rostro con una máscara de hielo protectora y dotar su placa dorsal de cuchillas glaciales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "！\u0004\t前方宙返ぜんぽうちゅうがえ前方宙返りして　せびれを　こおらせたつるぎで　こうげきする。つよい　あしこしの　なせるわざ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "앞으로 공중제비를 돌며 등지느러미를 얼려서 만든 검으로 공격한다. 강한 하체를 요구하는 기술이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會使出前空翻，並利用凍住背鰭形成的劍來攻擊對手。唯有具備強健的下盤才能練就此功夫。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses pattes et son dos musclés lui permettent de faire des sauts périlleux puis d’attaquer ses adversaires avec les lames glacées de sa crête.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine starken Beine ermöglichen es ihm, einen Vorwärtssalto zu machen und mit den Klingen seiner gefrorenen Rückenflosse anzugreifen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gracias a su poderoso tren inferior, da saltos mortales hacia delante y ataca a sus enemigos con las cuchillas de su placa dorsal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Colpisce il nemico con le lame ghiacciate della cresta dorsale facendo una capriola in avanti. Questo attacco richiede gambe molto potenti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It attacks with the blade of its frozen dorsal fin by doing a front flip in the air. Arctibax’s strong back and legs allow it to pull off this technique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "！\u0004\t前方宙返ぜんぽうちゅうがえ前方宙返りして　背びれを　凍らせた剣で　攻撃する。強い　足腰の　為せる業。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "冻住背鳍，并使其形成剑，再使出前空翻来攻击对手。完成此举需要强健的腰腿。",
      "language": {
